<title>BULGARIA: NO CORPORATE STOCKS TRADE ON BULGARIA BOURSES.</title>
<headline>NO CORPORATE STOCKS TRADE ON BULGARIA BOURSES.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The RABSI (Reuter All Bulgaria Stock Index) was unchanged from Tuesday's 41.02 points as no corporate stocks traded on the two local exchanges, brokers said.</p>
<p>There were no repo deals in treasury paper either.</p>
<p>Bank shares were bid and offered on the Bulgarian Stock Exchange but the bid and offer prices did not match.</p>
<p>-- Dessislava Popova, Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-84561</p>
</text>
